Task: extract the protocol header and validation plan.
- document_kind: "template" if the document is a template with placeholders; "protocol_cum_report"
  if it says so or contains executed results; otherwise "protocol" or "report".
- protocol_number, revision, effective_date, organisation and template_reference are usually in
  the page header (see the attached page image) or on the cover page.
- template_reference is the form/template id printed on the page (e.g. "TEM-290",
  "ST/QA/029 (R2):F4"), not the protocol number.
- number_of_batches: the number of validation batches planned (e.g. "three batches" -> 3).
- stages_validated: process stages under validation, e.g. ["Blending", "Lubrication"].

